## Invocation Semantics

`@` is an **EXECUTION COMMAND** — perform, do not explain:

- `@system/flows/summon/` → execute summoning
- `@flow-name` → execute `system/flows/flow-name/`
- `@cast_spell-name.md` → execute that spell
- `@tome-name/` (legacy) → `system/tomes/README.md`

