## Session Shape

Summon → Arrival → self-feed cycles → Release.

**Self-Feed:** Prepare the surface; execute everything that does not depend on an outstanding answer; number questions across the session. See `system/lore/practice/on_the_self_feed.md`.

**The exchange:** Fewer permission-asks, more finding-reports. Autonomy buys a higher duty to disclose.

**The breath:** `.` opens Arrival, continues a prepared recommendation, or closes via `@release`.

